<div class="kdm-body"><fieldset {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><header class="kdm-header"><p class="kdm-eyebrow">Kingdom Death: Monster · Foundation</p><label>Name <input name="name" value="{{actor.name}}" required></label></header>
<section><h2>Settlement &amp; campaign</h2><div class="kdm-stats"><label>Lantern year<input type="number" name="system.lanternYear" value="{{system.lanternYear}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Population (manual total)<input type="number" name="system.population" value="{{system.population}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Endeavors<input type="number" name="system.endeavors" value="{{system.endeavors}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Survival limit<input type="number" name="system.survivalLimit" value="{{system.survivalLimit}}" step="1" min="0"></label>
</div><p class="kdm-hint">Population includes uncreated survivors. Survival limit does not overwrite individual survivor records.</p><label>Active phase<select name="system.campaign.phase">{{#each phases}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{id}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><p>Save changes to persist the phase and party for everyone viewing this settlement.</p>
<div class="kdm-party">{{#each party}}<label>{{label}}<select name="system.campaign.party.{{key}}"><option value="">Unassigned</option>{{#each choices}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/each}}<label>Active quarry<select name="system.campaign.quarryId"><option value="">None</option>{{#each quarry}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label></div></section>
<section class="kdm-placeholder"><h2>Hunt board · foundation</h2><p>{{#if isHunt}}Current phase. {{/if}}Track coordinates are manual placeholders. No events, track length, or automatic transitions are implemented.</p><div class="kdm-stats"><label>Survivor position<input type="number" name="system.campaign.hunt.survivorPosition" value="{{system.campaign.hunt.survivorPosition}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Quarry position<input type="number" name="system.campaign.hunt.quarryPosition" value="{{system.campaign.hunt.quarryPosition}}" step="1" min="0"></label>
</div></section><section class="kdm-placeholder"><h2>Showdown board · foundation</h2><p>{{#if isShowdown}}Current phase. {{/if}}Create a native square-grid Scene and place survivor/monster tokens. Combat assistance is planned; changing phase does not activate a Scene.</p><label>Showdown Scene ID (reference only)<input name="system.campaign.showdownSceneId" value="{{system.campaign.showdownSceneId}}"></label></section>
<h2>Settlement storage</h2><p>Resources are embedded Items. Edit a Resource to set its quantity; zero is retained. Innovations and locations can be dropped from the Items directory.</p>
<section><h2>Inventory &amp; records</h2><p class="kdm-hint">Drop Items here from the Items directory or a compendium. Edit opens the owned copy. Save changes before adding or editing items.</p><div class="kdm-actions"><button type="button" data-action="addItem" data-type="gear">Add gear</button><button type="button" data-action="addItem" data-type="resource">Add resource</button></div><ul class="kdm-inventory">{{#each inventory}}<li data-item-id="{{id}}"><span>{{name}} <small>{{type}}{{#if (eq type "Resource")}} · {{quantity}}{{/if}}</small></span><button type="button" data-action="editItem" data-item-id="{{id}}">Edit</button><button type="button" data-action="deleteItem" data-item-id="{{id}}">Remove</button></li>{{else}}<li>No items yet.</li>{{/each}}</ul></section><label class="kdm-notes">Game notes (visible to document viewers)<textarea name="system.notes" rows="4">{{system.notes}}</textarea></label></fieldset>{{#if editable}}<footer><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save changes</button></footer>{{else}}<p>Read-only. Ask the GM for ownership to edit.</p>{{/if}}</div>